## Install

{%- if template_type == 'java' %}
{%- if project_kind == 'cli' %}

Java CLI projects need a `Main-Class` in the jar manifest. Add it before
publishing.

Download the runnable jar from the releases page. Run it with:

    java -jar <jar-file>
{%- else %}

Add the library to your build.

Maven:

```xml
<dependency>
  <groupId>{{ java_group_id }}</groupId>
  <artifactId>{{ java_module }}</artifactId>
  <version>{{ java_version }}</version>
</dependency>
```

Gradle (Kotlin or Groovy DSL):

```kotlin
dependencies {
    implementation("{{ java_group_id }}:{{ java_module }}:{{ java_version }}")
}
```
{%- endif %}
{%- elif template_type == 'typescript' %}
{%- if project_kind == 'cli' %}

Add a `bin` field to `package.json` before publishing.

Install globally with your package manager:

```sh
npm install --global {{ ts_scope }}/{{ first_package }}
pnpm add --global {{ ts_scope }}/{{ first_package }}
```
{%- else %}

Install the package:

```sh
pnpm add {{ ts_scope }}/{{ first_package }}
```
{%- endif %}
{%- else %}

Copy the configuration files you need into your project.
{%- endif %}

